Neutral grey: #64748B

Do not introduce unrelated primary brand colours, gradients or visual styles that conflict with MsmeBooks.

Design Requirements
Use the latest approved MsmeBooks logo.

Professional typography such as Inter, Manrope or Plus Jakarta Sans.

White backgrounds with blue headings and carefully applied lemon-green highlights.

Modern SaaS-style layout with generous spacing.

Clean, readable policy typography.

Rounded cards, subtle borders and minimal shadows.

Responsive desktop, tablet and mobile layouts.

Consistent header, footer, navigation and buttons across all MsmeBooks landing pages.

Accessible colour contrast and keyboard navigation.

Avoid excessive illustrations, distracting animations or promotional elements that undermine the seriousness of a legal document.

